Honestly, the photos in A and D would annoy me more than they'd help. A bowel tumour on a packet of Doritos just makes me feel lectured, and I'd probably buy the Doritos to spite it. The calorie badge is the one I'd actually notice, because I'm on the blood pressure list and I'd like a number I can compare, even if I still end up picking the Dairy Milk on a Thursday.

Plain text warnings I'd skip past without reading, because I already know a Gü isn't a health food.

